{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1295631-where-are-all-the-animals-and-mutations","id":1295631,"title":"Where are all the animals and mutations?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-10T13:39:39-07:00","id":1295631,"title":"Where are all the animals and mutations?","content":"Long time no see, gang! I\u2019m loving Fangs at the Gate, but am also having a bit of difficulty finding animal stat blocks, mutations, and latent abilities in the official material? Am I just missing it, or is it more a matter of making it yourself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1247-maseiken","name":"Maseiken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1247_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T13:43:43-07:00","id":1295632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maseiken</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1295631-where-are-all-the-animals-and-mutations#post1295631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Long time no see, gang! I\u2019m loving Fangs at the Gate, but am also having a bit of difficulty finding animal stat blocks, mutations, and latent abilities in the official material? Am I just missing it, or is it more a matter of making it yourself?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mutations are the Merits in the Traits chapter (+ appropriate ones in the corebook). Animal stat blocks will be in the final chapter that drops on Tuesday along with some big name Lunar npcs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T13:49:18-07:00","id":1295634,"title":"","content":"Also there's some good supplemental PDFs on drive thru, the Hundred Devil Nights Parade ones, that have some really cool animals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T13:49:34-07:00","id":1295635,"title":"","content":"Oh they are still coming! I got the impression the preview material was over, but that\u2019s good then. Super psyched to rebuild an old character of mine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1247-maseiken","name":"Maseiken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1247_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T15:42:28-07:00","id":1295671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1295631-where-are-all-the-animals-and-mutations?p=1295634#post1295634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also there's some good supplemental PDFs on drive thru, the Hundred Devil Nights Parade ones, that have some really cool animals.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually already made a list of all the animals currently published in Hundred Devils Night Parade, which in my judgment constitute animals:<br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Northern Ursidae (Giant Gilled Polar Bear)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Giant Boa Constrictor Aurochs</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Austrech, exalted name for Terror Bird, a real life terrifying ice age murder-ostrich, distinct from the Death Moa, exalted name for the (I kid you not) real life &quot;Demon-Duck of Doom&quot; or &quot;Thunderduck&quot; that was published in the core book. I may note that these two seemingly similar animals have distinct mechanics.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Eight-Tailed Mole Hound</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Armored Kraken Metagalapan Riding Hawk (Includes rules for Great Roc)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Elephant / Mammoth</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Strix</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Forest Striders, which are Giant Stick Insects<br /> <br /> I'd also note that the following creatures are supernatural versions of natural creatures.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Mouse, Rat (derived from Mouse of the Sun without supernatural abilities)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Leech Hound -- The Bloodworm is described as a thing of the underworld, but the rules work perfectly for the Leech Hound from previous editions.<br /> Giant Sandworm, Graboid (derived from Ghostfisher)<br /> It's also easy to forget that you can easily derive a shark from the fogshark, since the fogshark isn't listed in the animals section.<br /> <br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24366-slarn","name":"Slarn!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24366_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T16:42:30-07:00","id":1295688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"